OL,3,GNEWSASix months of searching for a
OL,4,Amissing capybara
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix months after escaping from a zoo, a
OL,7,Fmissing capybara that sparked interest
OL,8,Faround the world - and a trend for AI
OL,9,Fmemes - remains at large in the
OL,10,FHampshire countryside.
OL,12,FMarwell Zoo, near Winchester in
OL,13,FHampshire, is still searching for
OL,14,Fone-year-old Samba, who attracted
OL,15,Fglobal interest after she went on the
OL,16,Frun earlier this year.
OL,18,FThe saga began on 17 March when Samba
OL,19,Fand her sister Tango broke out through
OL,20,Fa small gap in a temporary enclosure.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
